    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/1411.3369v1</id>
    <title>A proof of Bondesson's conjecture on stable densities</title>
    <updated>2014-11-12T21:49:51Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1411.3369v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/1411.3369v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>We show that positive $α$-stable densities are hyperbolically completely monotone if and only if $α\le 1/2$. This gives a positive answer to a question raised by L. Bondesson in 1977.</summary>
